    "question": {
      ":question/id": "fc6a9e0c-4c19-5604-bef7-b249db80919e",
      ":question/problem": "Without using a calculator, find the exact value of\n\n$$\n\\sin\\left(\\frac{7 \\pi}{12}\\right)\\cos\\left(\\frac{7 \\pi}{12}\\right)\n$$\n\n$$\n\\sin\\left(\\frac{7 \\pi}{12}\\right)\\cos\\left(\\frac{7 \\pi}{12}\\right)=\n$$\n{{value}}",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use the double-angle formula for sine and keep the multiplier.\n\nSet $x=\\frac{7 \\pi}{12}$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2\\sin x\\cos x &=\\sin(2x) \\\\ &=\\sin\\left(\\frac{7 \\pi}{6}\\right) \\\\ &=- \\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstitute this exact value:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sin\\left(\\frac{7 \\pi}{12}\\right)\\cos\\left(\\frac{7 \\pi}{12}\\right)&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(- \\frac{1}{2}\\right) \\\\ &=- \\frac{1}{4}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
